Number":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"5235","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"3229","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"3229","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"79044","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"81479","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"31859","synopsis":"Ren is currently settling in the Kuonji household and trying to get used to Shinra's antics and innuendo teasing both to him and her sister Miyu. However fed up being constantly teased by her sister Shinra, Miyu suggest a capture the flag competition in the Kuonji mansion, in which the winner can do whatever they want to the losers.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ptMZ7LqhqMTLA8ry1fZTMjkp5AU.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 3","synopsis":"Ren is currently settling in the Kuonji household and trying to get used to Shinra's antics and innuendo teasing both to him and her sister Miyu. However fed up being constantly teased by her sister Shinra, Miyu suggest a capture the flag competition in the Kuonji mansion, in which the winner can do whatever they want to the losers.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ptMZ7LqhqMTLA8ry1fZTMjkp5AU.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"5235","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"3229","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"3229","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"79044","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"81479","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"31855","synopsis":"After Ren makes a mistake whilst making tea for Miyu. Shinra decides to have everyone relax at the beach. Shortly after arriving, Ren undergoes hard training to ensure he can make tea in the best way possible. At the same time Benis and Natose end up at the mercy of some loan sharks in a casino.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/odhU349jZC31N1gkAfNCBxg9pVy.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 4","synopsis":"After Ren makes a mistake whilst making tea for Miyu. Shinra decides to have everyone relax at the beach. Shortly after arriving, Ren undergoes hard training to ensure he can make tea in the best way possible. At the same time Benis and Natose end up at the mercy of some loan sharks in a casino.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/odhU349jZC31N1gkAfNCBxg9pVy.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"5235","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"3229","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"3229","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"79044","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"81479","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"31854","synopsis":"Ren and Benis are kidnapped by some thugs. During their captivity, Benis talks about her past and what she did before she met the Colonel.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bzvTqvO70ak9lSdai1gFD5NIIfd.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"Ren and Benis are kidnapped by some thugs. During their captivity, Benis talks about her past and what she did before she met the Colonel.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bzvTqvO70ak9lSdai1gFD5NIIfd.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"5235","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"3229","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"3229","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"79044","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"81479","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"31862","synopsis":"Yume furiously writes in her journal late at night, and leaves for school the next morning forgetting both her lunch and her panties. Exhausted and asleep that afternoon, Yume's journal is examined by a curious Ren. After discovering its shocking contents (where Yume styles herself an incredibly popular magical girl crime fighter), Ren calls a meeting the next day for everyone to discuss bringing out Yume's true self. However, Yume seems to have no aptitude for any of their suggestions (ranging from taking up a hobby to joining a girl gang). That evening Ren encourages Yume, and she rewards him with a kiss.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zKEpnhHI1nf389l7K9yLXq8cvYK.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"Yume furiously writes in her journal late at night, and leaves for school the next morning forgetting both her lunch and her panties. Exhausted and asleep that afternoon, Yume's journal is examined by a curious Ren. After discovering its shocking contents (where Yume styles herself an incredibly popular magical girl crime fighter), Ren calls a meeting the next day for everyone to discuss bringing out Yume's true self. However, Yume seems to have no aptitude for any of their suggestions (ranging from taking up a hobby to joining a girl gang). That evening Ren encourages Yume, and she rewards him with a kiss.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zKEpnhHI1nf389l7K9yLXq8cvYK.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"5235","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"3229","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"3229","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"79044","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"81479","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"31860","synopsis":"Accompanied by her troop of loyal soldiers, heiress to the Kuki Conglomerate and friend of Yume, Ageha Kuki, arrives at the Kuonji household. Ageha frequently engages in vigorous martial arts training with her servant Kojūrō, but after he accidentally fell down a waterfall after a particularly active session her father decided to send Ageha to the Kuonji household to learn self-restraint. After having the mansion cleaned up and offering gifts to the Kuonji women, she begins to train with Ren. Ren throws himself in front of Ageha to save her from an assassin's dart, and even though this proves unnecessary as Ageha was able to grab the dart herself she rewards his loyalty with a kiss.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/a5LEn7L42yjtUt1e3KECtzo7e8M.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"Accompanied by her troop of loyal soldiers, heiress to the Kuki Conglomerate and friend of Yume, Ageha Kuki, arrives at the Kuonji household. Ageha frequently engages in vigorous martial arts training with her servant Kojūrō, but after he accidentally fell down a waterfall after a particularly active session her father decided to send Ageha to the Kuonji household to learn self-restraint. After having the mansion cleaned up and offering gifts to the Kuonji women, she begins to train with Ren. Ren throws himself in front of Ageha to save her from an assassin's dart, and even though this proves unnecessary as Ageha was able to grab the dart herself she rewards his loyalty with a kiss.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/a5LEn7L42yjtUt1e3KECtzo7e8M.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"5235","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"3229","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"3229","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"79044","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"81479","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"31853","synopsis":"Kojūrō finally recovers and awaits Ageha to finish school and go home with him, she goes back to the Kuonji household as she is attracted to Ren. Kojūrō sees Ren and Ageha kissing and challenges Ren to a duel. The winner gets to keep Ageha.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8IB9SmTpj5l9BuWo3oGlP60cVfO.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"Kojūrō finally recovers and awaits Ageha to finish school and go home with him, she goes back to the Kuonji household as she is attracted to Ren. Kojūrō sees Ren and Ageha kissing and challenges Ren to a duel. The winner gets to keep Ageha.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8IB9SmTpj5l9BuWo3oGlP60cVfO.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"5235","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"3229","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"3229","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"79044","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"81479","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"31861","synopsis":"While undertaking the task of being Miyu's personal attendant, Ren becomes concerned with Miyu's apparent lack of direction. Meanwhile, Yume is increasingly bothered by the lack of attention she is given, especially by Shinra.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/OZRMD0fe1y7qZ7lK5STILuRGXg.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 9","synopsis":"While undertaking the task of being Miyu's personal attendant, Ren becomes concerned with Miyu's apparent lack of direction. Meanwhile, Yume is increasingly bothered by the lack of attention she is given, especially by Shinra.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/OZRMD0fe1y7qZ7lK5STILuRGXg.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"5235","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"3229","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"3229","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"79044","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"81479","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"31851","synopsis":"Yume goes missing from the Kuonji household due to an argument with her sister Shinra. Ren and Natose go out to search for her, and more is revealed about Natose's past and the reason for her affection to Ren and Yume. It turns out that Shinra actually cares for Yume the most when she returns home, and it is revealed that the Kuonji siblings lost their parents since a young age. Shinra had to be strong in order to keep her family together, which caused her apparent emotionless state as a child.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/AmqoMW5Tu4a92FVp8ViNSwWyUv6.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 10","synopsis":"Yume goes missing from the Kuonji household due to an argument with her sister Shinra. Ren and Natose go out to search for her, and more is revealed about Natose's past and the reason for her affection to Ren and Yume. It turns out that Shinra actually cares for Yume the most when she returns home, and it is revealed that the Kuonji siblings lost their parents since a young age. Shinra had to be strong in order to keep her family together, which caused her apparent emotionless state as a child.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/AmqoMW5Tu4a92FVp8V